The paper's own general Corollary 3.3 gives a multiplicative factor 16/\mathsf{C}_{\varphi,1}; using Lemma 3.3 (\mathsf{C}_{\varphi,1}=\min_{\hat{y}
eq y}\ell(\hat{y},y)) yields 16/\min_{\hat{y}
eq y}\ell, while the structured-prediction specialization claims 8/\min_{\hat{y}
eq y}\ell. The text does not justify this halving; the two statements are inconsistent.

